    <!-- EXPERIENCE -->
  <section id="experience" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-20">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold mb-5">Experience</div>
    <div class="time-line-container">
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Overseas Language &amp; Technical Training at Korea Chamber of Commerce &amp; Industry (KCCI)"
        subtitle="From September 2026 to November 2026 at ITB, Bandung, Indonesia"
      >
        A 200 hours language training and 300 hours hands-on electronics program separated into 3 modules. The firmware module covered embedded C,
        MCU structure, interrupts, timers, serial communication, and FreeRTOS. The electronics module
        covered schematic design, component library development, PCB layout, placement and routing, design
        verification, and Gerber generation. The FPGA module covered Verilog, combinational and sequential logic,
        finite state machines, and implementation on an FPGA board.
      </TimeLineElement>
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Research Assistant at Directorate of Research and Innovation, ITB"
        subtitle="From December 2025 to July 2026 at Bandung, Indonesia"
      >
        Investigated how autonomous vehicles can steer around potholes while keeping the ride smooth. Collected and
        annotated road damage dataset, built the detection model, and designed motion planning algorithm. This
        work was supported by ITB and National Taiwan University of Science and Technology (NTUST).
      </TimeLineElement>
      <TimeLineElement title="System Engineer (Intern) at PT. AVS Simulator" subtitle="From July 2025 to August 2025">
        Created replica of a MOZA R12 steering system on an STM32 microcontroller to be used in a truck driving
        simulator.
      </TimeLineElement>
      <TimeLineElement
        title="Vice Director, Mechanical Division at KRSTI (University Robotics Unit)"
        subtitle="From August 2024 to August 2025 at Bandung, Indonesia"
      >
        Built 2 humanoid robots for a robotics competition. Also assembled an Anet A8 3D printer to make and replace robot parts.
      </TimeLineElement>
      <TimeLineElement title="Embedded Engineer (Intern) at PT. Cultination" subtitle="From June 2024 to August 2024">
        Built an automated monitoring system for fish ponds, with sensors and ESP32 firmware feeding live readings to a
        smartphone app.
      </TimeLineElement>
    </div>
  </section>

