            <span class="badge badge-secondary shrink-0">ASCC 2026</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm opacity-75 mt-2">
            YOLOv11 road damage detection and a DQN planner in CARLA. 100% avoidance in bright weather and 84% in rain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Project 2 -->
      <a href="/projects" class="block rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition">
